WEBVTT

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:11.910
Get them.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:12.560
Don't let them get away...

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.020
Kill them! Kill them!

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:16.690
Wait!

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.290
Wait, Thor!

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:20.850
Rai!

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:27.360
Let's go, Rai.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.910
It'll be okay, Rai.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:45.620
I'll protect you, in place of Papa and Mama.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.610
The Balkan Galaxy consists of the star Balkan,

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:21.610
its ten orbiting planets,

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:24.160
as well as two colonies.

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:25.660
All the planets in Balkan have been terraformed.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:28.240
[Chapter 1: Destiny]

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.900
Man has made these planets suitable for people to live on.

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:34.910
Starting about 350 years ago,

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:37.240
as a result of the migration from the Solar system,

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:40.320
human beings entered the age of two great galaxies.

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:45.710
This, located 50 light-years away, is our home planet;

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:49.260
The third planet of the Solar system, the Earth.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.720
Beautiful isn't it, Rai.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:56.510
Hey, Thor, let's go back.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:57.310
Huh?

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:59.560
Mama will be angry again.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.270
We even ignored the car that came to pick us up.

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:04.520
Today we have a health check anyway.

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.110
I know!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.610
Wait!

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:38.310
Did you know, Rai...

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.030
Eh?

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:42.640
People on the Earth

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:46.560
can live 90 years, even without lifeguard systems.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:51.440
E-eh? In the Colony even living 50 years is impressive.

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:53.400
Why's there such a difference?

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:54.740
The environment?

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.570
Or could it be the gravity?

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:01.580
I... I'll go to Earth someday.

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:04.790
When I graduate from the elementary courses.

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:07.880
I'll attend a professional training school and become a pilot.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.170
As Klein's son?

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:12.300
Even Odin said

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.800
"You should both follow in your parent's footsteps

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:16.840
and become excellent scientists."

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.310
Odin might be the Prime Minister of Juno,

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:23.520
but that guy has no right to make decisions about our future.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.520
Only the super elites are allowed to go to the Earth.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.230
Even with Papa's influence...

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:32.480
It's because we're not allowed to go that l want to go.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.160
There are real oceans and real fields on the earth.

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:40.620
l want to see that beautiful planet with my own eyes.

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:49.540
Then, I'll become a scientist and come to the earth with you, Thor.

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:50.780
Yeah.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:02.310
Eh? It's so dark. A blackout?

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:06.270
Mama said she wouldn't be going out today, right?

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:07.170
Wait!

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:10.690
What is it?

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:19.740
Strange... the power seems to have been cut off somewhere

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.410
but the security system didn't trigger.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:23.700
What do you mean?

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:25.950
You just hide here.

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:29.360
Eh? No way! I'm coming too!

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:47.230
Papa?.. Mama?..

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:55.610
Mama! Hey, Mama! Mama!!!

00:05:55.950 --> 00:06:00.190
No!!! Don't die!!!

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:04.410
Who... Who did this?..

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:19.090
Rai!

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:37.690
The Federal Army's Special Forces...

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:43.660
They should be protecting Papa... Why?

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:49.640
When I opened my eyes again, what I saw was...

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:52.310
...a world where only vigorous plants existed.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:09.790
Where are they?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:10.870
Not here.

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:11.660
Find them!

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:14.160
O-oww...

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.250
Are you ok? Rai.

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:23.880
Mmm. This planet... is it even in the Balkan Galaxy?

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:28.970
Yeah, I've definitely I've never heard of a planet where there are just plants.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:30.760
Where are we?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:33.310
And who were those people?

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:34.350
Who knows.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.190
All I know for sure is...

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.730
We've been abandoned here.

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:41.730
What is this?

00:08:42.050 --> 00:08:42.730
What?

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:45.200
It was in my pocket somehow.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.410
Smells really strong.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.370
And ...this too.

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:52.770
That's...

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:53.980
A Beam Knife.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:00.490
This... will we have to use it to fight?

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:07.830
Well, we should keep moving.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:08.500
Mmm.

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:11.290
O-ow!

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:13.210
Did you twist your ankle?

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:14.750
I'm fine!

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:16.500
It's not serious.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.420
It is not fine!

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:23.010
Here. You were always taking care of me on Juno, right?

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:25.140
Whenever I was getting in trouble...

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:28.310
Sorry.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:30.430
You don't need to apologize.

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:34.520
Rai!

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:37.640
The grass is moving!

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:39.060
Let go of him! You!...

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:50.160
We found them.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.080
Don't let them go.

00:09:51.620 --> 00:10:10.470
Kill em'... Kill... These bastards... Kill em'...

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:11.380
Hold it.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.910
I'll take care of these two.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:26.410
Ok, right?

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:29.830
Alright, since Zagi says so.

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:31.500
...until nightfall...

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:32.870
Ok, it's decided.

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:33.850
Ok... alright...

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:35.000
...that's fine then...
Ok... alright...

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:36.130
Let's go.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:42.010
Come here, twins.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.010
Who are you?

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:48.890
My name is Zagi, of Iliad.

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:52.140
Are you their leader?

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:54.440
I guess.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:58.610
You were the ones came that life-pod, right?

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:00.820
What did you do?

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:02.690
We didn't do anything!

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:05.780
Fair enough.

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:07.200
Come.

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:09.660
Where are you taking us?!

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:13.830
To teach you about this planet.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:22.300
This is the prison planet for ferocious criminals, Chimera.

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:28.550
This planet has 181 days and 181 nights in its cycle.

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:33.270
The temperatures can reach up to 30 degrees during the day, and drop to -40 degrees at night.

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:36.310
Is Chimera a planet in Balkan Galaxy?

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:38.350
I don't know why.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.770
But no one knows about the existence of this planet.

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:42.730
Then...

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:47.240
Ah! Not again...

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:52.450
On this planet almost all the vegetation is carnivorous.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.080
You'll have to be careful.

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:56.620
This is Musa's sap.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.370
They really can't stand this smell.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:02.540
If you wear this, you won't be attacked.

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:06.970
It's the same smell.

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:08.430
I see ..

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:12.100
That's how you crossed the Semi Forest without being killed.

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:14.720
Seems like there's something underhanded going on here...

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:15.930
Underhanded?

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:17.310
Who knows...

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.060
This tree is a Calypso.

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:26.190
Calypso sap can enter through your respiratory system and suck out bodily fluids.

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:29.610
Hold the bag open towards where I'm to cut

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:32.390
- and hold your breath for a second.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.420
This sap will live for 12 hours.

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:43.040
It's very useful if you use it well.

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:46.960
On this planet, the plants have the advantage.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:50.680
The only way to survive, is to revert back to being a beast.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:53.050
Beast?

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:56.180
That's what the people here say about this planet.

00:12:57.430 --> 00:12:59.940
Only the King of Beasts can survive on this planet...

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:01.900
Jyu Oh Sei. (Planet of Beast King)

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:06.900
Chimera only has one continent.

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:10.900
It is divided and ruled by 4 Rings.

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:12.240
Rings?

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:15.280
Blank, Sun, Night

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:16.790
and Ochre.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:20.540
People with the same skin colour gather and establish their territories.

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:23.000
You're divided by skin colour?

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:26.880
Back on Juno, it's easy to change your skin colour.

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:30.970
Which Ring does this place belong to?

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:33.890
We don't belong to any Rings.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:37.640
Here is where abandoned children gather and live together.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.180
It's the "Wild Children's Nest".

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:40.230
Hurry up!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.350
There are no girls here?

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:45.230
On Chimera, man and women live separately.

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:49.440
So, there isn't any way to leave this planet?

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:54.570
There is a way.

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:56.370
But only one.

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:57.660
Tell me!

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:02.410
If you stand above each ringleader of the four Rings,

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:05.000
and become the "Jyu Oh" (Beast King).

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:07.130
Jyu Oh?

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:11.260
Like the name suggests, the King of the Planet of the Beast King.

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:14.890
In the centre of the continent, if you climb the tower known as the Dagger Pagoda,

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:18.640
you'll win the ability to move between Hecate and Chimera freely.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.730
Which means, we're being controlled.

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:24.270
We are controlled by people of Juno.

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:32.110
You two... you're totally different, even though you have the same face, aren't you?

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:36.990
White skin... blue eyes... silver hair.

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:42.200
For two like you to exist, really is a miracle.

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:47.330
Miracle...? We're just twins.

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:49.090
It's not that unusual...

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:51.550
You!

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:52.760
What did you do?!

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:54.050
You bastard!!

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:56.050
This guy spilled the water!

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:57.680
The precious water...

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:58.600
You piece of crap!

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:00.140
I m sorry.

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:04.270
You have to be punished if you do something wrong. That's the rule here.

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:06.480
It doesn't matter if you're Zagi's.

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:08.230
I'm sorry!

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:11.940
Keeping a guy like you around will cost the rest of us our lives.

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.690
Take this!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.070
Stop it!

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:20.490
Rai!

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.120
Are you ok?

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:24.830
Stay out of it! Get lost!

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.210
I'll take the punishment for him,

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:28.970
so, let Rai go!

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:31.040
You're a newcomer!

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:34.210
How dare you?

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:36.470
Trying to order us around?!

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:37.760
You piece of rubbish!

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:38.890
We don't need two guys with the same face.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:45.890
Sorry.

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:49.440
I'm real sorry, Thor.

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:51.230
I'm sorry.

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:53.730
He's really pretty beat up, isn't he?

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:56.780
Water's running out;

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:59.030
that's why everyone's getting uneasy.

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:05.700
Why don't you go out for a little while?

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:14.420
As long as Rai is alive, your life's going to be harsh.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:17.670
Do you want to die for him?

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:20.840
Leave him if you want to live.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.680
That guy is too weak. He'll die sooner or later.

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:26.350
Rai is my little brother.

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:28.980
Your stubbornness will only last until nightfall.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:31.400
Chimera's nights are very harsh.

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:35.030
In order to survive, at night the wild children will eliminate the weak ones.

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:37.690
No doubt, Rai will be their target.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.450
A if you help him, you will be too.

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:47.410
I'm not going to die! Not like this!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.710
I'm definitely going to survive!

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.580
Wait up, Thor!

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:54.630
It's hot.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:59.050
Thor! I'm really thirsty...

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:01.740
Hey, can I drink some water?

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.180
Thor!!.

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.230
No, you just drank some.

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:10.640
Please, just a bit?

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:13.480
We don't have time to waste here!

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:14.690
Let's go.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.320
No!!!

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:19.950
I cant walk anymore.

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:23.120
We've already walked for more than 5 hours!

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:25.700
The heat is driving me insane.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.410
Zagi was right.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:32.540
As long as Rai's with me, I won't be able to survive.

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:34.630
If I were alone...

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.670
Leave him if you want to live.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:40.870
How could I do that?!

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:42.260
I've had enough!!!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.390
We should've just stayed with Zagi.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.680
I'd rather die than keep on doing this.

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:53.020
I understand.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.730
Then... go on, die.

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:00.650
If I just leave you here,

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:02.490
you'll die in less then three days.

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:09.660
Stop it, Thor.

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:32.350
Thor, stop. Stop...

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:40.570
Those blue-gray eyes

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.200
are reflecting me...

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:45.360
another me.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:52.800
They're here!

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:57.380
Wild children?

00:18:57.770 --> 00:18:59.040
No, it's not.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.380
It's you guys, right?

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.970
Causing trouble around here.

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:10.100
This is the Ochre Ring's territory.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.770
You intruded into our territory,

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:15.020
and broke our Ring's rules.

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:19.190
A one who breaks the rules must be killed in front of our leader.

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:20.150
Thor...

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.150
Now, give up and come along quietly.

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:24.400
Wait a second.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:27.570
We just came here from the Colony.

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.810
We didn't know anything about the Rings here.

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:32.160
So can't you forgive us. Please.

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:33.540
No way.

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:36.090
Please ask the leader to forgive us.

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:38.370
Look, I'll give you this -

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:41.300
It's a beam knife from the Colony.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:45.630
Look, with this switch you can control the length of the knife.

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:47.840
Oh? Let me see...

00:19:58.240 --> 00:19:59.270
Second!

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:02.720
Rai!

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:03.480
Run!

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:05.610
You won't get away!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:08.410
Rai!

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:09.360
Shit.

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:12.450
Idiot!

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:13.650
Don't shoot here!

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:18.960
Rai!

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:21.290
Thor!

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:31.090
Rai!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.730
Rai!!!

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:04.290
Black eyes... nostalgic... It's been so long since I saw them.

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:06.260
...eyes as black as night...
